    {
      "id": "claim_a530e77583644a6b98346465f460aa0d",
      "statement": "The app has no persistence: received files are assembled into an in-memory Blob once the declared size is reached and downloaded on demand via an object URL (single files and a bulk store-only ZIP export); nothing is stored in IndexedDB, localStorage, or any server.",
