      "id": "claim_01b030b8e442430d99dea88e20528d48",
      "statement": "MetaData.size is int64 on the wire (widened from int32 in commit 721c502 / PR #42), so files of 2 GiB or larger no longer throw 'invalid int32' during Message.encode; tests/protocol-size.test.mjs pins this by encoding and round-tripping 3 GiB and MAX_SAFE_INTEGER sizes through the generated proto code.",
